    **1D array sum**

    >>> jnp.einsum("i->", x)  # requires explicit form
    Array(6, dtype=int32)
    >>> jnp.einsum(x, (0,), ())  # explicit form via indices
    Array(6, dtype=int32)
    >>> jnp.sum(x)
