  Examples:
     Extract values from a 1D array:

     >>> x = jnp.array([1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6])
     >>> mask = (x % 2 == 0)
     >>> jnp.extract(mask, x)
     Array([2, 4, 6], dtype=int32)

