    (Array([0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 2], dtype=int32), Array([0, 1, 2, 1, 2, 2], dtype=int32))

    Elements indexed by ``jnp.triu_indices_from`` correspond to those in the
    output of ``jnp.triu``.

